<title>UK: CRICKET-GLAMORGAN V AUSTRALIA MATCH ENDS IN DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLAMORGAN V AUSTRALIA MATCH ENDS IN DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day tour match between Glamorgan and Australia ended in a draw on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 369-4 declared and 217-7 declared. Glamorgan 254 and 211-3.</p>
</text>
